# Harland Kernel Boot-Test Self-Tests and Diagnostics
#
# Moved out of kernel_main (AGAST #2752). boot_self_tests runs only in
# boot-test mode (AGAST #1887), before SYSCALL is set up, and
# boot_process_tests after it (#4712); the boot gate asserts their
# "[boot-test]" lines. postinit_diagnostics runs on every boot
# after SYSCALL setup, before /bin/init: the PCI listing and the MSI-X
# checks the interrupt boot tests read. The network diagnostics are opt-in
# since #4335: a misbehaving NIC made a real-hardware boot panic before
# init ran.

